This is the Q-Learning update rule.
Q-Learning formula
\[
Q(s,a)\leftarrow Q(s,a)+\alpha
[r+\gamma\max Q(s',a')-Q(s,a)]
\]

Symbol	Meaning
\(Q(s,a)\)	Current Q-value
\(\alpha\)	Learning rate (0.1)
\(r\)	Immediate reward
\(\gamma\)	Discount factor (0.9)
\(s'\)	New state
\(\max Q(s',a')\)	Best future Q-value


In your code:
